  "totalBlocks": 50,
  "translatedBlocks": 50,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab1b174fdff8ef68",
      "translationZh": "几周前，我们写过一篇文章，介绍如何用 gr.HTML 一次性生成完整的 Web 应用：使用自定义 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript，完全在 Gradio 内构建功能丰富、交互性强的前端。这解锁了许多可能性。但如果这些还不够呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d04689b439c02ca",
      "translationZh": "如果你想完全使用自己的前端框架来构建应用，比如 React、Svelte，甚至是纯 HTML/JS，同时仍能享受 Gradio 的排队系统、API 基础设施、MCP 支持，以及 Spaces 上的 ZeroGPU，该怎么办？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50a41ecf37070665",
      "translationZh": "这正是 gradio.Server 要解决的问题。它也改变了使用 Gradio 和 Hugging Face Spaces 所能实现的可能性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f6f26b7ebf9f6de5",
      "translationZh": "我们想构建什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b62de3b5dbbb41da",
      "translationZh": "Text Behind Image：一款编辑器，你上传照片后，它会使用机器学习模型移除背景，然后让你在前景主体与背景之间放置风格化文字。文字看起来就像位于图像中的人物或物体后方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "950cb3948abfde53",
      "translationZh": "这需要：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dfb13e12584ecb3c",
      "translationZh": "一个支持拖放操作和分层渲染的画布（背景 → 文字 → 前景）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db171aff4bb6abfe",
      "translationZh": "一个功能丰富的控制面板，配备滑块，可调节字号、字重、字间距、颜色、不透明度、描边、阴影、3D 挤出、透视变换等属性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b46b70a3bf4098e",
      "translationZh": "一个后端 ML 端点，运行背景移除模型并返回透明 PNG 图片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e43204c9e4c49d38",
      "translationZh": "在客户端导出为 PNG",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bb12d9e29b4c3df",
      "translationZh": "无法用 Gradio 组件实现这样的 UI。这是一个完整的 Web 应用。但我们仍然希望拥有 Gradio 的后端能力：排队、并发管理、ZeroGPU 支持，以及在 HF Spaces 上托管，而不必为基础设施头疼。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f10a7410aa45a184",
      "translationZh": "gradio.Server 登场",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff2405c888101d79",
      "translationZh": "gradio.Server 扩展了 FastAPI。它让你能够充分利用 FastAPI 的全部能力（自定义路由、中间件、文件上传、任意响应类型），同时在此基础上加入 Gradio 的 API 引擎：排队、SSE 流式传输、并发控制，以及 gradio_client 兼容性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce2b577b6bf97e99",
      "translationZh": "以下是 Text Behind Image 的完整后端：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b5f2749acdf366b",
      "translationZh": "就是这些。约 50 行 Python。模型在启动时加载，@spaces.GPU 负责处理 ZeroGPU 分配，gradio.Server 则管理排队和并发。接下来我们逐一解析其中的运作过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "34a577bdf374b11c",
      "translationZh": "为什么使用 @app.api()，而不是普通的 FastAPI 路由？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b42978b44467313",
      "translationZh": "如果这是一个普通的 FastAPI 应用，你会定义一个 @app.post() 路由来移除背景。这种方式能用，直到两个用户同时发起请求。如果没有并发管理，两个请求就会争抢 GPU，导致应用崩溃或返回无效结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2312fc24997b7edb",
      "translationZh": "@app.api() 解决了这个问题。它使用 Gradio 的排队引擎封装你的函数：请求会被串行处理，并发受到控制；而在 ZeroGPU Spaces 上，GPU 分配会通过 @spaces.GPU 自动处理。还有一个额外的好处：任何 @app.api() 端点也都可以通过 gradio_client 调用，因此其他应用或脚本可以通过编程方式使用你的 Space：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ba165c8db6ff34a",
      "translationZh": "与此同时，@app.get(\"/\") 是一个标准的 FastAPI 路由，用于提供 HTML 页面。两者可以自然共存，因为 Server 本身就是一个 FastAPI 应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e083856eaf6664ae",
      "translationZh": "前端：纯 HTML/CSS/JS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d85197a9587b1af",
      "translationZh": "本示例中的 index.html 是一个独立完整的 Web 应用，约有 1300 行。没有 React，没有构建步骤，也没有打包工具。只有原生 HTML，具备以下功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52048aa9974abced",
      "translationZh": "三层画布：背景图像 → 文字层 → 前景（透明 PNG），通过 CSS z-index 叠放",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97e17477447a333f",
      "translationZh": "使用指针事件，通过拖放来定位文字",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6a69d2b7681d080",
      "translationZh": "一个包含 20+ 个参数的控制面板：字体系列（25+ 种字体）、字号、字重、间距、颜色、不透明度、背景填充、描边、阴影、3D 挤出深度和角度、旋转、倾斜，以及完整的 CSS 透视变换",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56a48e870908cb03",
      "translationZh": "使用 <canvas> 合成，在客户端导出 PNG",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "990f81e4dd335a7b",
      "translationZh": "前端使用 Gradio JS Client 与后端通信：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "191daec0ab0902de",
      "translationZh": "这是关键所在：使用 Gradio JS client 而不是直接调用 fetch()，前端请求就会经过 Gradio 的队列。这意味着并发会得到管理，GPU 请求不会相互冲突，你甚至还可以向用户显示排队位置或处理进度。其他所有操作，包括文本渲染、图层合成和导出，都在浏览器中完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4401661b65acc58b",
      "translationZh": "这带来了哪些新可能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31c7dfc6d877de27",
      "translationZh": "以下是在 gradio.Server 出现之前无法实现的事情：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bb725005055412c",
      "translationZh": "之前",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b68fe5510851da3",
      "translationZh": "之后",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6daa424e20cdde6",
      "translationZh": "自定义 UI 意味着要完全脱离 Gradio",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad7d070d4bcc98ed",
      "translationZh": "使用 Gradio 的后端引擎构建自定义 UI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9489990af03d044e",
      "translationZh": "无法通过 Gradio 应用提供静态 HTML",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf2166084e02513f",
      "translationZh": "@app.get(\"/\") 可以提供任何内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "180d0e2e852b6a92",
      "translationZh": "gradio_client 过去只能用于基于 Gradio 组件的应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e41578e6e5ce1ed5",
      "translationZh": "@app.api() 端点与客户端兼容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c45e3953ba0a3e6",
      "translationZh": "在 Gradio 的基础设施与设计自由之间做选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b63a29b5da39e6f1",
      "translationZh": "两者皆可兼得",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42470bf175021636",
      "translationZh": "有了 gradio.Server，Gradio 也可以充当后端框架：需要时使用它的 UI 系统，不需要时则使用你自己的前端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cce2cdbc7b24166a",
      "translationZh": "如果你想使用 Gradio 的 UI，可以使用 gr.Blocks、gr.Interface、gr.ChatInterface。如果你想使用自己的 UI，就使用 gradio.Server，并搭配任何你喜欢的前端。无论哪种方式，你都能获得 Spaces 托管、API 排队、gradio_client 访问、完整的 HF 生态系统等支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "967bbf8ffaffc5d0",
      "translationZh": "动手试试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d7a0dbb3ffe7819",
      "translationZh": "该应用已在 Spaces 上线：ysharma/text-behind-image",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6152f9cba625328",
      "translationZh": "上传任意一张主体清晰的照片，就可以开始将文字叠放在主体后方。试试 3D 挤出、透视倾斜和描边效果，它们组合起来效果很不错。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22cf4040e2249bde",
      "translationZh": "接下来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0de0f4b7433134f",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍了核心思路：gradio.Server 让你可以将任意前端与 Gradio 的后端配合使用。还有更多内容值得探索，包括通过 @app.mcp.tool() 注册 MCP 工具、用于实时更新的 SSE 流式传输、批处理，以及构建具有共享状态的多页面应用的模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d593ecba74774330",
      "translationZh": "我们将在后续文章中深入探讨这些内容。敬请期待。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4ae2f5bc81b5bea8",
      "translationZh": "推荐阅读",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "442cb72884991c48",
      "translationZh": "文档：gradio.Server",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ec8afb52e033313",
      "translationZh": "指南：服务器模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "one-shotting",
      "briefZh": "一次性生成",
      "explanationZh": "指通过一次操作或一次提示就生成完整应用，而不是分多轮逐步构建。"
    },
    {
      "term": "queuing system",
      "briefZh": "排队系统",
      "explanationZh": "对请求进行排队并安排处理的机制，用于管理并发任务。"
    },
    {
      "term": "layered rendering",
